Package: mt7663-dkms
Version: 1.0.11
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), build-essential
Maintainer: Van der Decken <elsangithub@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: MediaTek MT7663 SDIO Wi-Fi Linux DKMS Driver
 Production-grade, turnkey out-of-tree DKMS driver for MediaTek MT7663
 (PCI/SDIO 037a:7663) Wi-Fi chipsets on ARM64 Linux kernels (6.x - 6.18+).
 Includes hardware queue tuning, IRQ interrupt balancing, and high-throughput
 buffer sysctl optimizations.
